  description: |-
    NKSFB is the deepest entertainment business management practice with a Los Angeles address. Recording Artist Services and Touring Services are separate named service lines. Athlete Services is a third.

    The firm describes its clients as "the world's top music, film, and television artists, athletes, executives, entrepreneurs, and other high-net-worth individuals." NKSFB reports more than 650 employees across seven offices.

    Ownership is where the site falls down. Its history page says the firm joined Focus Financial Partners in 2018 and still describes Focus as "NASDAQ: FOCS." Focus is no longer a listed company. Nothing on nksfb.com says what happened after that.

    The homepage title tag calls NKSFB "America's #1 Business Management Firm." The site publishes nothing to support that ranking.
  pros:
  - Touring and recording workflows are built as service lines, so a client does not have to explain how
