- rank: 7
  name: Windes
  url: https://windes.com
  startingPrice: Not published. Windes publishes no fee or range on any page.
  bestFor: Companies that need an employee benefit plan audit from a dedicated practice rather than an
    add-on.
  description: |-
    Windes turned 100 in 2026. Its managing partner marked the centennial in a message dated 13 January 2026.

    The firm is organised around four partner in charge practices: Audit and Assurance, Tax, Advisory, and Employee Benefit Services. That fourth one is the reason to look. A standalone benefit plan practice with its own partner in charge is rare at this size.

    Windes names its clients as "privately held businesses, nonprofit organizations, and high-net-worth individuals." Its main office is in Long Beach. Its Los Angeles office is on Flower Street downtown.

    It added capability in mid 2026. Gary Greene's tax practice moved across from Harris, Greene LLP on 1 July 2026. It brought ten professionals plus estate, gift and real estate work.
  pros:
  - The employee benefit practice is led by a partner holding both the APA and ERPA credentials, which
