  - Runs a delivery centre in Clark Global City in the Philippines, rare for a firm of this size.
  - Published a news release on 11 August 2026, so the site is actively maintained.
  - No SEC or PCAOB action was found against the firm.
  cons:
  - Los Angeles is a satellite rather than the base, so the partners a client meets may work from Long
