  - The Los Angeles address is printed as "515 Flower Street" with no directional, which is an incomplete
    address.
  - The site publishes no total headcount. Only the 24 partners, principals and directors on the leadership
    page can be counted.
  - A July 2026 release headlined as Southern California expansion describes an Orange County addition.
