    The business side is tiered rather than priced. Four levels run from Essentials through outsourced accounting to a fractional controller and a fractional CFO. The firm aims those at "growing businesses with lean internal teams."

    It also publishes an AI advisory service, which almost no firm of this size does. Accounting Today named it a West Coast regional leader and a Firm to Watch on 20 March 2024.
