    The firm has operated since 1979. It describes its clients as "some of the most prestigious professionals in the entertainment and sports industries as well as other high net-worth individuals."

    Client Accounting Services and Tax and Accounting sit alongside those two practices, so a client can keep the compliance work in the same place.

    Its site is the most neglected of any firm ranked here. The footer reads "© 2018 GURSEY | SCHNEIDER LLP" on the same page template as an article published on 25 August 2026.

    The people directory does not work. Loading it returns "Your search has returned no results. Please try again," so the roster never appears.
